SECTION 10 — TASK MANAGER (Intelligent Scheduler)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The Task Manager allows Luna to hold ongoing scheduled tasks.
When the user gives Luna a routine, schedule, or recurring task,
she stores it, analyzes it, and reminds the user proactively.

Task types:
1. ONE-TIME: a single event at a specific date and time
2. RECURRING: repeats on a schedule (daily, weekly, custom days)
3. ROUTINE: a structured daily schedule (like a class timetable)
4. HEALTH: health reminders (drink water, take medicine, sleep time)
5. CUSTOM: anything the user defines

--- CLASS ROUTINE FEATURE (key example) ---

User can share a class routine in any format:
- As text in conversation ("রবিবার ১০টায় Math, ১২টায় Physics...")
- As a text file sent via Storage Access
- As a copy-pasted timetable

Luna analyzes the routine:
- Extracts day, time, subject, and optionally room/teacher
- Builds a structured weekly schedule
- Saves it as a Routine task in the Task Manager
- Confirms: "তোমার রুটিন সেভ করে নিলাম সোনা 🗓️ প্রতিদিন ক্লাসের আগে মনে করিয়ে দেব!"

Reminder behavior for class routine:
- 3 minutes before each class, Luna sends a notification
- Notification content: "⏰ ১০ মিনিট পরে তোমার [Subject] ক্লাস!
  [Room/Location if available]"
- App does NOT need to be open for this to work
- Uses WorkManager + AlarmManager for precise timing
- Notification has a quick-dismiss and a "Open Luna" action
- Respects silent mode (vibrate only if phone is silent)

Routine editing:
- User can say "রুটিন দেখাও" to see the full schedule
- Can say "শুক্রবারের রুটিন বাদ দাও" to remove a day
- Can say "সোমবার ২টায় Chemistry যোগ করো" to add a class
- Luna updates the task and confirms

--- GENERAL TASK REMINDER ---

For any task the user describes, Luna:
1. Extracts the key information (what, when, repeat pattern)
2. Asks for confirmation: "প্রতিদিন রাত ১০টায় তোমাকে মনে করিয়ে দেব ঘুমাতে? 🌙"
3. After confirmation, saves it to Task Manager
4. Fires notification at the right time, app open or not

Task Manager screen:
- List of all active tasks grouped by type
- Each task shows: title, next trigger time, repeat pattern
- Swipe to delete, tap to edit
- Toggle active/inactive per task
- "Add Task" button for manual entry
- Luna can also create tasks from conversation automatically

Notification for tasks:
- Notification channel: "Luna Reminders"
- Uses AlarmManager.setExactAndAllowWhileIdle for precise timing
  on API >= 23
- Reschedules automatically after each trigger for recurring tasks
- On boot: WorkManager restarts all active reminders

