SECTION 18 — VOICE STATE MACHINE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

States: IDLE, LISTENING, PROCESSING, SPEAKING, ERROR

Transitions:
IDLE → LISTENING (mic tapped or wake phrase detected)
LISTENING → PROCESSING (speech complete or timeout)
PROCESSING → SPEAKING (AI response received)
SPEAKING → IDLE (speech finished)
LISTENING → IDLE (cancelled by user)
PROCESSING → IDLE (cancelled where possible)
PROCESSING → ERROR (network or API failure)
SPEAKING → IDLE (interrupted by user)
ERROR → IDLE (after showing error message)

Rules:
- No overlapping SpeechRecognizer instances
- No duplicate API requests
- Release audio focus correctly on pause/stop/destroy
- UI state must always match actual state
- Error state shows Luna with a sad emoji: "আরে, কী হলো এটা 😕
  একটু পরে আবার চেষ্টা করো"

